PULL REQUEST POLICY:

All pull requests require EXPLICIT WRITTEN PERMISSION from the Author
(SowinySoft) before submission. This includes but is not limited to:

  1. Bug fixes
  2. Feature additions
  3. Documentation changes
  4. Translation contributions
  5. Code refactoring
  6. Performance improvements

To request permission for a pull request:
  - Contact SowinySoft via GitHub: https://github.com/SowinySoft
  - Or email: SowinySoft@gmail.com
  - Wait for explicit written approval BEFORE creating the pull request

Unauthorized pull requests will be closed without review.

